  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.6.1 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.6.1: Linux/macOS label fixes (the native Skia canvas and font are disposed on each redraw; deprecated SkiaSharp text APIs retired). No API changes.\n2.6.0 - The platform release: .NET 10 + MonoGame 3.8.5; same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.6.0, without the content-pipeline build target. Migration: retarget your game to .NET 10 and bump the package reference.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
